      "design": "d2r4B",
      "good": "Fits the viewport, with intact identifiers and numbers and a consistent body-row rhythm.",
      "problems": "The wider first column breaks the identifier heading as 受检服务 / 器唯一编 / 号, leaving a single character on the last line. The log heading also splits 日志留存. Other narrow headings retain the same awkward word breaks.",
      "cause": "The 78px first column changes its heading to a four-character measure that is poorly suited to its phrasing; the 64px fourth column loses the useful break seen in d2r4A."
